# NOTE: `.git` must stay OUT of this list. The Label Studio runner checks out the
# training branch inside the already-built container (`git pull && git checkout
# <branch>` with WORKDIR /mmsegmentation), so the image needs a real git
# repository there. Excluding `.git` makes every branch training fail with
# "fatal: not a git repository".
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info
.eggs
dist
build
*.ckpt
*.pth
*.pt
